description:
This program is supposed to calculate and print the total sum of the array elements `{5, 10, 15}` (expected output: `30`), but it prints `15` because of a bug in how elements are accumulated. Find the bug and rebuild the corrected program.
```
public class ArraySum {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int[] numbers = {5, 10, 15};
        int total = 0;
        for (int i = 0; i < numbers.length; i++) {
            total = numbers[i];
        }
        System.out.println(total);
    }
}
```
